{"candidateAnswer":"Growth and perseverance through difficult times","evidence":"[D8:11 | 1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023] Caroline: Thanks Melanie - love the blue vase in the pic! Blue's my fave, it makes me feel relaxed. Sunflowers mean warmth and happiness, right? While roses stand for love and beauty? That's neat. What do flowers mean to you?","itemId":"urn:uuid:8d26d4f3-54ff-5072-b20e-acf7dcfd2ab8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:bb3acc1674a367dbe6a8aa2360c5b5ae65f6681a4de05ab6cfd66e858a0b60dd","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What do sunflowers represent according to Caroline?","referenceAnswer":"warmth and happiness","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"bb3acc1674a367dbe6a8aa2360c5b5ae65f6681a4de05ab6cfd66e858a0b60dd"}}]}